# WP-HLOD-APPROX (UE UHLODBuilderMeshApproximate + FMeshApproximationSettings, IGeometryProcessing_ApproximateActors):
# the far layer of WP_Protocol (HLOD_Main_Far, always loaded, parent of the spatially loaded HLOD_Main - see
# SCOPE-FAR-HLOD.scn) is built twice, first MeshSimplify (the bar to beat), then MeshApproximate at 100 cm.
# World Partition format v12 (Core::kWorldPartitionVersion; UE UHLODBuilderMeshApproximateSettings): MeshApproximate is
# the 4th registered HLOD builder and its FMeshApproximationSettings are the layer's builder `Settings`
# (Core::HLODApproximationSettings). The block below is WP_Protocol's (as WP-HLOD-BUILDERS.scn states it) with only
# HLOD_Main_Far changed; the chain HLOD_Main -> HLOD_Main_Far is partition Main's HLODSetups.
# Expected log lines (editor.log):
#   MeshSimplify build:   "[Build HLODs] <dir>/<HLOD_Main_Far cell file>: <N> bytes" x 16
#   MeshApproximate build: 16 x "[Build HLODs] approximation A<key>: <S> source triangles -> <W> wrapped (<V> voxels
#   along the longest side, <C> inner cavities removed) -> <T> triangles within <d> cm" with T << S and d <= 10;
#   then "capturing the textures of 16 approximated cell(s)", 16 x "captured approximation A<key>: 14 photos, ..."
#   and the HLOD_Main_Far files far smaller than the MeshSimplify ones (one mesh, one material each).
# LEAD: (1) the whole WorldPartition block is set (as WP-HLOD-BUILDERS.scn does) - if WP_Protocol's own block
# differs, keep the file's values and change only HLOD_Main_Far. (2) Build HLODs refuses an unsaved scene: the `save` line is the save form this build has (the
# File > Save action); (3) the capture runs over editor frames - `advance` until the 16 "captured approximation"
# lines are in the log before Play. (4) Restore at the end puts HLOD_Main_Far back to MeshMerge and rebuilds.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано set world WorldPartition '{"RuntimePartitions":[{"Name":"Main","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":2500,"LoadingRange":20000,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main"},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main_Far"}]},{"Name":"Foliage","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":1280,"LoadingRange":6400,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Foliage"}]},{"Name":"LandscapeTiles","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":5000,"LoadingRange":51000,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Landscape"}]}],"HLODLayers":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"Instancing","CellSize":51200,"LoadingRange":102400},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","Type":"MeshSimplify","Settings":{"TrianglePercent":0.25}},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"}],"ChunkRegionSize":100000}'
Дано run File "Save"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
# Long enough for a landscape bake of the MeshSimplify build to finish: a second Build HLODs is refused while one runs.
Дано advance 600
Дано set world WorldPartition '{"RuntimePartitions":[{"Name":"Main","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":2500,"LoadingRange":20000,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main"},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main_Far"}]},{"Name":"Foliage","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":1280,"LoadingRange":6400,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Foliage"}]},{"Name":"LandscapeTiles","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":5000,"LoadingRange":51000,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Landscape"}]}],"HLODLayers":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"Instancing","CellSize":51200,"LoadingRange":102400},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","Type":"MeshApproximate","Settings":{"WorldSpaceApproximationAccuracy":100,"ClampVoxelDimension":1024,"WindingThreshold":0.5,"FillGaps":true,"GapDistance":10,"GeometricDeviation":10,"TextureSize":1024,"CaptureResolution":2048,"NormalMode":"HardEdges","HardNormalAngle":60}},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"}],"ChunkRegionSize":100000}'
Дано run File "Save"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано advance 1500
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000003 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 1003 CameraData.Far 800000
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 10
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60000,-150000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.4,1
Когда advance 2
Тогда approx_far город с 1.5 км - HLOD_Main_Far: кварталы цельными оболочками без щелей между домами, без серых блоков - каждый в своих цветах (стены, крыши), края стен/крыш жёсткие; лог: 16 строк "approximation A…: S source triangles -> … -> T triangles" с T в разы меньше S, файлы HLOD_Main_Far в разы меньше, чем после MeshSimplify
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,15000,-40000
Когда advance 2
Тогда approx_mid ближе (400 м): на границе HLOD_Main / HLOD_Main_Far нет дыр и двойных домов; оболочка без внутренних полостей (не просвечивает)
Когда run Action "Stop"
# Restore: the far layer back to MeshMerge, saved and rebuilt, so the world is what the other WP scenarios expect.
Когда set world WorldPartition '{"RuntimePartitions":[{"Name":"Main","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":2500,"LoadingRange":20000,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main"},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main_Far"}]},{"Name":"Foliage","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":1280,"LoadingRange":6400,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Foliage"}]},{"Name":"LandscapeTiles","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":5000,"LoadingRange":51000,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Landscape"}]}],"HLODLayers":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"Instancing","CellSize":51200,"LoadingRange":102400},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","Type":"MeshMerge"},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"}],"ChunkRegionSize":100000}'
Когда run File "Save"
Когда run Scene "Build HLODs"
# The restore build bakes over editor frames too; let it write its files before the editor closes.
Когда advance 600
